  <rocket>
    <name>Pods With Recovery</name>
    <id>26a4f2f3-5767-400a-a422-2ad5d5412d6a</id>
    <axialoffset method="absolute">0.0</axialoffset>
    <position type="absolute">0.0</position>
    <comment>This shows a simple rocket with a center motor and two powered  pods, with streamers in the pods. While it is intended to fly with a booster motor such as an A8-0 in the center, it&#39;s necessary to call it a plugged motor in the simulation to keep the streamers from ejecting when it burns out.</comment>
